      "headings": ["Install", "Quickstart", "CLI", "Architecture", "Testing"],
      "text": "# solid-tool\n\nSmall CLI for diffing spreadsheet schemas. MIT licensed, stdlib only.\n\n## Install\n\npip install solid-tool\n\n## Quickstart\n\nsolid-tool diff a.xlsx b.xlsx\n\n## CLI\n\nSee `docs/cli.md` for the full flag list. Output is JSON by default.\n\n## Architecture\n\n`src/differ.py` does the comparison, `src/report.py` renders it.\n\n## Testing\n\npytest -q, 41 tests, CI on 3.10/3.11/3.12. Benchmark on a 50k-row sheet:\n2.1s (see benchmarks/).\n\n## Method\n\nThe comparison is a set diff over normalised column signatures; we publish\nsample datasets under demo/ so results are reproducible.\n"
    },
